                                                            <div class="aa-tl-wrap" id="aaTimelineWrap" style="display:none;"><div class="aa-tl-empty">Loading alerts...</div></div>
                                                            @* v1.0.1.2: the table gets its OWN Station / Cause Code filters, in
                                                            the same shape Alert History uses: a labelled select per axis that
                                                            narrows the rows below it. They sit inside the table card but
                                                            OUTSIDE the horizontal scroller -- placed within it they would
                                                            slide sideways with the 1696px table and leave the viewport. They
                                                            write the SAME aaState fields the site rail and the cause chips
                                                            already use, so all three stay in agreement rather than being
                                                            three independent filters that can disagree. *@
                                                            <div class="aa-tblshell" id="aaTblWrap" style="display:none;">
                                                                <div class="aa-tbar">
                                                                    <label class="aa-tsel-wrap">
                                                                        <span class="aa-tsel-cap">Station</span>
                                                                        <select id="aaTblSelSite" class="aa-tsel" onchange="fnAaSelSite(this.value)"><option value="">All stations</option></select>
