                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="aa-tbl-wrap">
                                                                    <table class="aa-tbl">
                                                                        @* v1.0.1.0: explicit column widths. With 13 columns and no
                                                                        colgroup the browser re-measures on every render, so the
                                                                        header drifted out of line with the body while rows
                                                                        streamed in. Under table-layout:fixed these widths are the
                                                                        single source of truth and they sum to the table's
                                                                        min-width exactly -- change one, change the total. *@
                                                                        <colgroup id="aaColgroup">
                                                                            <col class="aa-w-sr" />
